# ---- Identifiable research data: NEVER commit ----
# Held in UQ Research Data Manager (RDM) under restricted access instead.
Qualitative Analysis/Consent Forms RESTRICTED/*
!Qualitative Analysis/Consent Forms RESTRICTED/README.md
Quantitative Analysis/Raw Data RESTRICTED/*
!Quantitative Analysis/Raw Data RESTRICTED/README.md

# Catch-all: anything flagged identifiable or confidential, wherever it sits
*RESTRICTED*.*
*IDENTIFIABLE*
*CONFIDENTIAL*

# ---- OS / editor noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
._*
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Office lock files ----
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pptx

# ---- Large media: store in UQ RDM and link to it from here ----
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
